{"nodes": [{"id": "agents_mod_reflectjournal", "label": "mod_reflectjournal (Reflection Journal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_moodle_5_3_lts", "label": "Moodle 5.3 LTS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_core_api_first", "label": "Core-API-first principle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every mechanism maps to a Moodle core API (ledger in docs/architecture.md); deviations need an ADR. Also bans APIs deprecated in 5.3 (\\external_* classes, FEATURE_GROUPMEMBERSONLY)."}, {"id": "agents_workflow_lifecycle", "label": "Seven-phase workflow lifecycle (Decide-Spec-Tickets-Plan-Execute-PR-Merge)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_one_skill_per_phase", "label": "One skill per phase", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exactly one skill is designated per workflow phase to avoid skill overlap: wayfinder/grill-with-docs over grilling/grill-me, superpowers:writing-plans over writing-implementation-plans, subagent-driven-development + test-driven-development over tdd, requesting-code-review over code-review. Full rationale in docs/workflow.md."}, {"id": "agents_adr_0006", "label": "ADR-0006 (workflow preferences override skill defaults)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AGENTS.md workflow preferences override the defaults of imported skills; also the reason git worktrees are disabled."}, {"id": "agents_no_git_worktrees", "label": "Git worktrees disabled (work in place)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The docker stack bind-mounts this exact path, so work in place: one feature branch at a time, never on main; sequential subagent implementers only, never two writers in this tree at once."}, {"id": "agents_phases_1_3_user_commands", "label": "Phases 1-3 are user-run slash commands", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "disable-model-invocation: the agent never runs /wayfinder, /grill-with-docs, /to-spec, /to-tickets, and never creates issues or milestones unasked; a ticket without a spec/plan means stop and ask."}, {"id": "agents_specs_canonical", "label": "Spec-first workflow (docs/specs canonical)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "docs/specs/NNN-slug.md is canonical; the parent issue links the spec but never duplicates it and gets no ready-for-agent label; spec reaches main via a small docs PR before tickets are cut."}, {"id": "agents_plans_convention", "label": "Plans convention (docs/plans/<issue#>-slug.md)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plan is committed as the first commit of the ticket's PR."}, {"id": "agents_milestones_m0_m9", "label": "Milestones M0-M9", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plan milestones M0-M9 mirror GitHub milestones."}, {"id": "agents_github_actions_ci", "label": "GitHub Actions CI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All checks run on push via moodle-plugin-ci across php 8.3/8.4 x pgsql/mariadb; phpdoc/validate/mustache/grunt need booted core so they run there, not locally."}, {"id": "agents_moodle_plugin_ci", "label": "moodle-plugin-ci", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_zero_phpcs_findings", "label": "phpcs zero findings criterion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "phpcs with the moodle standard must stay at zero findings - declared success criterion for the project."}, {"id": "agents_moodle_docker_stack", "label": "Moodle Docker stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every shell sources docker/env.sh (sets $MOODLE_DOCKER_BIN, wwwroot, port 8000). Start/stop keeps data - never 'down'; never 'down -v' or volume prunes without asking (DB has no volume; other projects share this host). Site at http://localhost:8000."}, {"id": "agents_never_modify_moodle_core", "label": "Never modify Moodle core", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "moodle/ is a checkout and must never be modified or committed; work in the plugin dir only."}, {"id": "agents_security_guardrails", "label": "Security guardrails", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "$DB API with param placeholders only; no raw SQL with user input; input via required_param/optional_param; writes behind require_sesskey(); require_login + require_capability on every route; walk docs/security-checklist.md per diff."}, {"id": "agents_business_logic_in_classes", "label": "Business logic in namespaced classes/", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Business logic lives in namespaced classes/; lib.php stays a thin bridge. GPL header + @package/@copyright/@license + PHPDoc on every PHP file; schema/capability change bumps version.php + db/upgrade.php savepoint (CI checks)."}, {"id": "agents_output_conventions", "label": "Output via renderer + Mustache + get_string()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_issue_tracker", "label": "GitHub Issues issue tracker (jeius/moodle-mod_reflectjournal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GitHub Issues via gh CLI; milestones M0-M9 mirror docs/plan.md; one PR per issue."}, {"id": "agents_triage_labels", "label": "Triage labels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defaults: needs-triage, needs-info, ready-for-agent, ready-for-human, wontfix."}, {"id": "agents_domain_docs", "label": "Single-context domain docs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single-context approach: root GLOSSARY.md for terms + docs/adr/ for decisions."}, {"id": "agents_graphify_knowledge_graph", "label": "Graphify knowledge graph", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snapshot of docs + code in graphify-out/ (graph.html, GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.json). Query before grepping for questions spanning documents (query/affected/path/explain); it can lag the working tree so the source file wins; refresh only on user request via /graphify . --update."}, {"id": "agents_graphify_skill", "label": "graphify skill (.agents/skills/graphify/)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agents_superpowers_using_git_worktrees", "label": "superpowers:using-git-worktrees", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_progress", "label": "docs/progress.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plan", "label": "docs/plan.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture", "label": "docs/architecture.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_workflow", "label": "docs/workflow.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_security_checkl